  "goodToKnow": "Der Verbraucherschutz is consumer protection. Each German state has a Verbraucherzentrale (consumer advice centre), and Stiftung Warentest, founded in 1964, publishes respected product tests; a good grade (Testsieger, sehr gut) is a big selling point. EU law gives online shoppers a 14-day Widerrufsrecht (right of withdrawal). Der Verbraucher is the consumer. It has no plural."
